 of Kentucky. From 2019 to 2021 he represented Kentucky's 43rd House district, making him the state's youngest Black lawmaker. He is the Democratic nominee for the 2026 U.S. Senate election in Kentucky.","extract_html":"<p><b>Charles Booker</b> is an American politician from the Commonwealth of Kentucky. From 2019 to 2021 he represented Kentucky's 43rd House district, making him the state's youngest Black lawmaker. He is the Democratic nominee for the 2026 U.S. Senate election in Kentucky.</p>"}